      "severity": "error",
      "description": "标题每个词首字母大写，介词、连词、冠词除外；计量单位可缩写（cm、oz、in、kg）",
      "fix_hint": "把每个实词的首字母改为大写",
      "source": {
        "url": "https://seller-us.tiktok.com/university/essay?knowledge_id=3196690250417921&lang=en",
        "section": "Product Title > Capitalize the first letter of each word",
        "retrieved_at": "2026-09-21"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "tt.title.special-chars",
      "check": "forbidden_chars",
      "scope": [
        "title"
      ],
      "chars": "~!*$?_{}#<>|;^¬¦",
      "ignore_brand": true,
      "severity": "warning",
      "description": "标题应避免使用这些符号：~ ! * $ ? _ { } # < > | ; ^ ¬ ¦（官方写“Avoid”，属最佳实践，故为警告）",
      "fix_hint": "删除这些符号",
      "source": {
        "url": "https://seller-us.tiktok.com/university/essay?knowledge_id=7073362639816491&default_language=en",
